{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55393","headline":"句 · 李□","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梦断海山远，夜长风雨多。\n（李中《碧云集》卷二《哭舍弟二首》注引。\n）（按：李中有《海城秋夕寄怀舍弟》、《哭舍弟二首》，其弟名未详，据李中三诗看，知其能诗，上录二句曾「传至海上」。\n归故里後卒，李中称其「夭枉」，身後有「遗稚」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李□","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}